#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:96
#: c85be1a542de4f039646bd9ecb9315a7
msgid ""
"The return (and loiter) point, unless "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` is enabled, is the geometric center "
"of the breached fence boundary. If :ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` is set "
"to a guided return mode (6 or 7), the altitude at which it returns is "
"determined by :ref:`FENCE_RET_ALT<FENCE_RET_ALT>` or if  "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_ALT<FENCE_RET_ALT>` is zero, midway between the altitude "
"limits, if non-zero. If both altitude limits are zero, then it will return "
"at current altitude."
msgstr ""
"返回（和盘旋）点，除非启用了 :ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>`，否则为被突破围栏边界的几何中心。如果 "
":ref:`FENCE_ACTION<FENCE_ACTION>` 设置为 Guided 返回模式（6 或 7），返回高度由 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_ALT<FENCE_RET_ALT>` 决定，或者如果 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_ALT<FENCE_RET_ALT>` "
"为零，则为高度限制的中点（如果非零）。如果两个高度限制都为零，则将在当前高度返回。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:98
#: 2f6400fdb0dd4ed08d7c041094a67fa7
msgid ""
"The return point can also be replaced by the nearest rally point (See: "
":ref:`common-rally-points`) as a destination, if "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>` is enabled."
msgstr ""
"返回点也可以被最近的集结点（见：:ref:`common-rally-points`）替代作为目的地，如果启用了 "
":ref:`FENCE_RET_RALLY<FENCE_RET_RALLY>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:100
#: b3a7ffc377bb4cbaba27c2c1be5842aa
msgid ""
"while executing any action that requires a mode change (ie. all except "
"Report Only), any additional fence breaches are recorded but ignored. For "
"example, RTL that has an AutoLand will breach a MIN_ALT fence, if enabled, "
"but take no action and finish the landing."
msgstr ""
"在执行任何需要模式切换的操作（即除仅报告以外的所有操作）时，任何额外的围栏突破都会被记录但忽略。例如，具有自动降落的 RTL 将突破 MIN_ALT "
"围栏（如果启用），但不会采取任何行动并完成降落。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:102
#: 0b9670ac650a4a6ba7cffda9e8b3997d
msgid ""
"Modes changes cannot be executed after the fence breach unless the "
":ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` bit 0 is set to \"0\". By default it is "
"set to \"1\" to prevent mode changes. When set, the vehicle must return to "
"within the fence boundary in order to change modes. If mode changes are "
"allowed, you can also return to the mode that was active upon breach by "
"using an RC auxiliary switch set to option \"96\" (Re-read mode switch)."
msgstr ""
"除非 :ref:`FENCE_OPTIONS<FENCE_OPTIONS>` 第 0 "
"位设置为「0」，否则突破围栏后无法执行模式切换。默认情况下设置为「1」以防止模式切换。设置后，飞行器必须返回到围栏边界内才能切换模式。如果允许模式切换，你也可以通过将设置为选项「96」（重新读取模式开关）的"
" RC 辅助开关返回到突破时的激活模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:106
#: 03f69e2735694dd99303ecd4a7d95d31
msgid "Enabling the Fence with an RC Channel Auxiliary Switch"
msgstr "通过 RC 通道辅助开关启用围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:108
#: aee1c07d38294008a220807442270dca
msgid ""
"It is not necessary to set-up a switch to enable or disable the fence but if"
" you wish to control the fence with a switch follow these steps:"
msgstr "不必设置开关来启用或禁用围栏，但如果希望用开关控制围栏，请按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:112
#: cf03e3fb5cfa4b15badf7fdde3ee84ec
msgid ""
"An ``RCx_OPTION`` can be set via the Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List "
"screen, for example using RC channel 7:"
msgstr ""
"可通过 Config/Tuning > Full Parameter List 界面设置 ``RCx_OPTION``，例如使用 RC 通道 7："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:114
#: 0522b232652e4a098a4263f175e9ea9d
msgid "Set :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 11 (Fence Enable)"
msgstr "将 :ref:`RC7_OPTION<RC7_OPTION>` = 11（围栏启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:115
#: 8b97cb58b79a4153931977de7f8540e4
msgid ""
"setting the switch high (i.e. PWM > 1800) will enable all configured fences,"
" low (under 1800) will disable all fences."
msgstr "将开关拨高（即 PWM > 1800）将启用所有已配置的围栏，拨低（低于 1800）将禁用所有围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:118
#: 7604391624854a17bad69c73afc32c41
msgid ""
"if the Minimun Altitude fence is enabled by the switch while on the ground "
"and disarmed, a pre-arm failure will occur preventing arming."
msgstr "如果在地面且未解锁时通过开关启用最低高度围栏，将发生解锁前失败，阻止解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:121
#: 17188bdc201b45b0af3702fcc2d64039
msgid "Automatic Altitude Breach Avoidance"
msgstr "自动高度突破规避"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:123
#: fc43141be7384aeb9b904992515f9e6f
msgid ""
"For landing modes (NAV_LAND,QLAND,LAND,etc.) in Copter and Plane, the "
":ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` limit is automatically disabled."
msgstr ""
"对于 Copter 和固定翼的降落模式（NAV_LAND、QLAND、LAND "
"等），:ref:`FENCE_ALT_MIN<FENCE_ALT_MIN>` 限制将自动禁用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:128
#: 1eef4a3bc3ad45239d078211cfeed898
msgid ""
"When in Mode FBWB or CRUISE, Plane will attempt to limit altitude target "
"changes by the pilot (ie using Pitch stick for climb/descent rate demand "
"inputs) to avoid breaching a maximum or minimum altitude fence."
msgstr ""
"在 FBWB 或 Cruise 模式下，Plane 将尝试限制飞手（即使用俯仰杆输入爬升/下降速率需求）的目标高度变化，以避免突破最大或最小高度围栏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:131
#: cc531295688a4531b0b556b5c1a02a02
msgid ""
"altitude control imperfections can still result in a breach unless the "
":ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` param is loose enough to accommodate these"
" imperfections."
msgstr "高度控制不完善仍可能导致突破，除非 :ref:`FENCE_MARGIN<FENCE_MARGIN>` 参数足够宽松以适应这些不完善之处。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:135
#: dd9bdfa6ea1b4511a8ca0f8a5da3c978
msgid "Enabling Fences in Mission Planner"
msgstr "在 Mission Planner 中启用围栏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:137
#: 9fe0a3b0e3104dea8f6c07e67203fb34
msgid ""
"To enable Fences, go to the Mission Planner full parameter list "
"(CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree), search for items with ``FENCE_``:"
msgstr ""
"要启用围栏，请进入 Mission Planner 完整参数列表（CONFIG->Full Parameter Tree），搜索带 ``FENCE_``"
" 的项目："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:151
#: a1ed7683445e4d79bfa432aaf75545e9
msgid "Use for R/C Training"
msgstr "用于 RC 训练"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:153
#: ca6bba1d87c14b3e97196044c635ba42
msgid ""
"One of the main uses of geo-fencing is to teach yourself (or someone else) "
"to fly radio controlled vehicles. When you have a properly configured geo-"
"fence it is very hard to crash, and you can try manoeuvres that would "
"normally be too likely to end in a crash, trusting the autopilot to 'bounce'"
" the vehicle off the geo-fence before the flight ends in disaster."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏的主要用途之一是教自己（或他人）驾驶遥控飞行器。当您正确配置了地理围栏后，坠机变得非常困难，您可以尝试平时风险太高的动作，信任飞控会在飞行灾难发生前将飞行器「弹回」地理围栏内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:160
#: 1c7960cbab1e467aae57bcdac23db3cc
msgid ""
"Geo-fencing can be combined with any flight mode. So for a raw beginner, you"
" would combine it with one of the stabilised flight modes . Once the pilot "
"has gained some confidence you could combine it with ACRO mode in Copter or "
"MANUAL mode in Plane, which gives direct control of the vehicle and allows "
"for the most interesting aerobatic manoeuvres."
msgstr ""
"地理围栏可与任何飞行模式结合使用。对于初学者，可与某种增稳飞行模式结合使用。当飞手获得一定信心后，可与 Copter 中的 Acro 模式或固定翼中的 "
"MANUAL 模式结合使用，这可直接控制飞行器并允许最有趣的特技动作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:167
#: f5e224ed84e043338a9e101d5c120fae
msgid "Stick-mixing on fence breach"
msgstr "突破围栏时的杆量混合"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:169
#: 4776f694a3fb479eb400e58908676bd2
msgid ""
"ArduPilot enables 'stick mixing' by default when in auto modes. This means "
"that you can change the path of a loiter, for example, by using your "
"transmitter sticks."
msgstr "ArduPilot 在自动模式下默认启用「杆量混合」。这意味着你可以通过使用遥控器摇杆来改变盘旋路径等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:173
#: 386ce24fed4e49d6a4a62c50405c25ff
msgid ""
"When you are using geo-fencing, stick mixing will be disabled on fence "
"breach until your plane is back inside the fenced region. This is to ensure "
"that the bad control inputs that caused you to breach the fence don't "
"prevent it from recovering to the return point."
msgstr "当你使用地理围栏时，突破围栏后将禁用杆量混合，直到飞机返回围栏区域内。这是为了确保导致你突破围栏的错误控制输入不会妨碍飞机恢复到返回点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:178
#: 4088c544462a46e1a48ba5264dee62ab
msgid ""
"As soon as you are back inside the fence stick mixing will be re-enabled, "
"allowing you to control the GUIDED mode that the plane will be in. If by "
"using stick mixing you manage to take the plane outside the fence again then"
" stick mixing will again be disabled until you are back inside the fence."
msgstr ""
"一旦你返回围栏内，杆量混合将重新启用，允许你控制飞机将处于的 Guided "
"模式。如果通过杆量混合再次将飞机带出围栏，则杆量混合将再次被禁用，直到你重新回到围栏内。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:187
#: 6ae2e1c19a26444d9ef1dff5725a7d32
msgid "MAVLink support"
msgstr "MAVLink 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:189
#: 983fe0e459f147f089add351f3424496
msgid ""
"ArduPilot will report the fence status via the MAVLink GCS protocol. The key"
" status packet is called FENCE_STATUS, and is defined in "
"\"ardupilotmega.xml\". A typical FENCE_STATUS packet looks like this:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 将通过 MAVLink GCS 协议报告围栏状态。关键状态数据包称为 "
"FENCE_STATUS，在「ardupilotmega.xml」中定义。典型的 FENCE_STATUS 数据包如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:197
#: 12d5edc58e9a45c49127a24c113a09ff
msgid ""
"The breach_status field is 0 if inside the fence, and 1 if outside. The "
"breach_count is how many fence breaches you have had on this flight. The "
"breach_type is the type of the last breach (see the FENCE_BREACH enum in "
"ardupilotmega.xml). The breach_time is the time in milliseconds of the "
"breach since APM was booted."
msgstr ""
"breach_status 字段在围栏内时为 0，在围栏外时为 1。breach_count 是本次飞行中围栏突破的次数。breach_type "
"是最近一次突破的类型（见 ardupilotmega.xml 中的 FENCE_BREACH 枚举）。breach_time 是自 APM "
"启动以来突破发生的时间（毫秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:203
#: 9623f939eed04f2d8d551fcd084c5a2d
msgid ""
"The MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE bit of the MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR portion of the "
"SYS_STATUS message indicates whether or not the geo-fence is breached.  As "
"of this writing only the MAVProxy GCS recognizes this status bit and reports"
" the status of the geo-fence.  In the future the Mission Planner, APM "
"Planner, and other GCS applications should get support for announcing geo-"
"fence status during the flight."
msgstr ""
"SYS_STATUS 消息的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_SENSOR 部分中的 MAV_SYS_STATUS_GEOFENCE "
"位指示地理围栏是否被突破。截至本文撰写时，仅 MAVProxy GCS 识别此状态位并报告地理围栏状态。未来 Mission Planner、APM "
"Planner 和其他 GCS 应用程序应获得在飞行期间宣布地理围栏状态的支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-geofencing-landing-page.rst:210
#: dc5d8eedb5ba48bc9b7d3d05486da6f6
msgid ""
"The MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink command message allows a GCS to enable "
"or disable a fence interactively.  As of this writing only MAVProxy supports"
" this message using the \"fence enable\" or \"fence disable\" commands.  In "
"the future Mission Planner, APM Planner, and other GCS applications may get "
"support for interactively enabling and disabling the geo-fence without "
"needing to use a manual transmitter."
msgstr ""
"MAV_CMD_DO_FENCE_ENABLE MAVLink 命令消息允许 GCS 以交互方式启用或禁用围栏。截至本文撰写时，仅 MAVProxy "
"支持此消息，使用「fence enable」或「fence disable」命令。未来 Mission Planner、APM Planner 和其他 "
"GCS 应用程序可能会获得无需使用手动遥控器即可交互式启用和禁用地理围栏的支持。"

